name spark-otf
category Package
revision 62481
shortdesc Support OpenType Spark fonts
relocated 1
longdesc The package supports the free fonts from "After the Flood"
longdesc which are available from AtF Spark. The following fonts are
longdesc supported: Spark -- Bar -- Medium Spark -- Bar -- Narrow Spark
longdesc -- Bar -- Thin Spark -- Dot-line -- Medium Spark -- Dot --
longdesc Medium Spark -- Dot -- Small
